	<<BombSquadC Reset Declaration>>
    public:
	<<BombSquadC Game Setting Interface>>
@

We include, in the [[BombSquadController]] class, the method used
for mouse clicks.
<<BombSquadC Class Definition>>=
    public:
	<<BombSquadC Mouse Click Declaration>>
@

The [[BombSquadController]] class also contains the member variables
